# A hand-labelled evaluation set for the conservative pronoun resolver.
# Each `# expect` line names the resolutions that SHOULD happen in that
# sentence, as `pronoun>antecedent:role`, separated by semicolons.  A sentence
# with no expect line should produce no resolution at all.  Deliberately
# includes ambiguous, distant, first/second person and gender-mismatch cases:
# the point is precision, not recall.
# This is a synthetic set written by hand, not a published annotated corpus.

# sent_id = 1
1	Jesus	Jesus	PROPN	NNP	Gender=Masc|Number=Sing	2	nsubj	_
2	came	come	VERB	VBD	_	0	root	_

